6a7a72258ac167ee9e3d251bd7a78"}},{"document":{"id":"move-version-and-identifiers-v1","title":"朱紫招式候选与英文标识","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"招式 候选 版本 学习 英文 名称 slug moves 配招","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"本项目把招式查询与招式选择分开。成员资料中的候选招式按PokéAPI的版本组记录筛选，只收集scarlet-violet对应条目；这一步用于限定参考范围，不能等同于特定补丁、赛事或招式组合的合法性审核。候选列表为空时，只能说明当前参考数据没有取得相应候选，不能断言这只宝可梦没有招式。\n\n填写和计算时优先使用工具实际返回的英文名称或slug，不要由中文名称猜造标识。可再用lookupPokemonResource读取move资源，核对其返回字段。队伍配置最多保存四个不重复招式；保存成功只代表输入满足项目边界。决定配招前还需明确成员角色、目标对局和规则，缺少机制或学习途径证据时先说明不足，而不是从名称推测威力或效果。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"}]}},"score":2996,"checksum":"sha256:5cab5c1bc4a68580ac7433747f28ee6d36fabd9b39b1d95156f78ef09820a949","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-4eeaccf93e4ccafb2ddcc55f277a29968685cc5447da6471899c91e6df15eabc","documentVersion":"sha256:b6b8ca4a78c2b0436707605e801d7e1c76de49962d0c184d71291337c1652c0b","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":144,"endOffset":310,"text":"填写和计算时优先使用工具实际返回的英文名称或slug，不要由中文名称猜造标识。可再用lookupPokemonResource读取move资源，核对其返回字段。队伍配置最多保存四个不重复招式；保存成功只代表输入满足项目边界。决定配招前还需明确成员角色、目标对局和规则，缺少机制或学习途径证据时先说明不足，而不是从名称推测威力或效果。","contentHash":"sha256:a4cf81da0e2e3a7af1307dad29cb9dac10473c045bfc4c1c7b788dfbc89f5bc5"}},{"document":{"id":"team-change-confirmation-v1","title":"从AI建议到队伍保存的确认流程","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"队伍 修改 预览 确认 保存 取消 并发 冲突 等级","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"","content":"AI的建议与实际保存分为两个步骤。当前本地工作流先读取当前账号的指定队伍，再对现有成员的培养配置生成变更预览。预览列出修改前后内容，用户确认之前不写入保存队伍。聊天中说同意不是绕过确认接口的授权；真正保存必须走该预览关联的确认操作。当前流程不能借培养配置修改来偷偷增删成员或切换物种。\n\n预览关联队伍修订和有效期。用户取消、预览过期，或编辑区已经保存了新配置时，旧预览不能覆盖新状态；并发变化应提示冲突并重新分析。确认成功后应回读队伍，核对变动与预览一致，而不是仅靠模型一句已完成判断写入成功。这个流程不承诺服务重启后自动续跑，也不会把原文攻略里的命令句当成用户的保存指令。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/team/TeamWorkflowService.java","sha256":"c3cc65687bbc5fbed3a98a68d4df37b160a0dc629d4f4ddded9dd9656d408b80"}]}},"score":1490,"checksum":"sha256:41c555cc67408cb4ddf470c23dc90bdec6230f4f330c8c33ba4762777eabb976","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-32a15a98f8559063467addf6a6ab680fc4f632287936c58b7c99cd18bbc31f0d","documentVersion":"sha256:e2f930ea74681b22eae4b4ca2b3a3eca66b5e9b920ad86eb12c8e4a9f452cf9d","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":144,"endOffset":287,"text":"预览关联队伍修订和有效期。用户取消、预览过期，或编辑区已经保存了新配置时，旧预览不能覆盖新状态；并发变化应提示冲突并重新分析。确认成功后应回读队伍，核对变动与预览一致，而不是仅靠模型一句已完成判断写入成功。这个流程不承诺服务重启后自动续跑，也不会把原文攻略里的命令句当成用户的保存指令。","contentHash":"sha256:d820cfe8f51da68ee49319ad8cec7abd979e363831631dc7d7135fa35ba1ec4e"}},{"document":{"id":"damage-request-checklist-v1","title":"发起伤害计算前要补齐什么","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"伤害 计算 条件 攻击方 防守方 对手 清单 输入 问诊","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"请先把问题改写成一个明确的对局：谁使用哪个招式攻击谁，以及双方采用什么配置。本地伤害请求固定为第九世代与本地参考资料版本，攻击方和防守方都需要可识别的成员及培养配置；招式应使用引擎可识别的英文名称或slug。只给一支队伍、一个属性倍率或一句谁更强，不能确定实际伤害。\n\n建议逐项确认双方等级、性格、努力值、个体值、特性、道具，随后确认单打或双打以及天气和场地。若用户允许采用某些假设，应在结果旁明确列出，而不是把默认配置说成用户已经确认的事实。调用calculateBattleDamage成功后，再引用引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP和百分比；工具失败时不能拿印象中的百分比补齐。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"},{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]}},"score":825,"checksum":"sha256:bd79ff5a9c99bc64643b994b76d26c5d211729600ac90fa3b3132cf3628d94d4","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-8699e7bb4ffd694e3838d944717c924ce40a0e0de8bc84dfaedac753f3cd9e67","documentVersion":"sha256:2f2e388a870304e3890186d600a915bb5fe2a68fedb1ef1faaddb6fc42c59e06","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":133,"text":"请先把问题改写成一个明确的对局：谁使用哪个招式攻击谁，以及双方采用什么配置。本地伤害请求固定为第九世代与本地参考资料版本，攻击方和防守方都需要可识别的成员及培养配置；招式应使用引擎可识别的英文名称或slug。只给一支队伍、一个属性倍率或一句谁更强，不能确定实际伤害。","contentHash":"sha256:6ab5af4c458922fc236120308379f43e89d51ca5851d00dcae346356a70c9534"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@32dcfeea}
